#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:6
#: a3aa13e4f50842568237ee450c4b1d04 d7580acec0794e9db20434db645a379b
msgid "Transmitter Based Tuning"
msgstr "基于遥控器的调参"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:8
#: 63c279406b794bc08540c61991c423fa be05834ae04e458794a0c261c640db27
msgid ""
"You can perform extensive parameter tuning in flight using your R/C "
"transmitter. This is meant for advanced users who are unable to use the "
"Autotune features or wish to do fine tuning with full manual tuning control "
"of each parameter"
msgstr "您可以在飞行中使用遥控器进行大量参数调参。此功能适用于无法使用 AutoTune 功能或希望对每个参数进行精细手动调参的高级用户"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:15
#: 8aadfc6066184da785393cdfb37b6422 cb1c5cd5751441ca8f15efff5588da28
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:17
#: 6966ab44383e4f4da8a4888612c590d7 89fb0075dd9e49b196cda85e5f44980a
msgid ""
"Transmitter based tuning allows you to tune a single parameter or a set of "
"parameters while flying. The basic idea is to link the tuning value of a "
"parameter to a knob or slider on your transmitter then to adjust the "
"parameter in flight by moving the knob."
msgstr ""
"基于遥控器的调参允许您在飞行时调整单个参数或一组参数。基本思路是将参数的调参值与遥控器上的旋钮或滑块关联，然后在飞行中通过移动旋钮来调整参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:25
#: 44de091041b24db6839f480cb9d3b8fa
msgid ""
"First you should set ``RCx_OPTION`` = 219, where ``x`` is a free RC channel "
"that will be used for transmitter tuning."
msgstr "首先应将 ``RCx_OPTION`` = 219，其中 ``x`` 是用于遥控器调参的空闲 RC 通道。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:29
#: 8eb5f5589f84440a8b1af191fddb01bf
msgid ""
"The :ref:`TUNE<TUNE>` parameter determines which parameter is being tuned."
msgstr ":ref:`TUNE<TUNE>` 参数决定当前调参的是哪个参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:31
#: f77743ff32804294ae34546e65d67bed
msgid ""
"The :ref:`TUNE_MAX<TUNE_MAX>` parameter determines the maximum value of the "
"parameter when the channel is at ``RCx_MAX``, while the "
":ref:`TUNE_MIN<TUNE_MIN>` parameter determines the value when tuning RC "
"channel is at ``RCx_MIN``."
msgstr ""
":ref:`TUNE_MAX<TUNE_MAX>` 参数决定通道处于 ``RCx_MAX`` 时参数的最大值，而 "
":ref:`TUNE_MIN<TUNE_MIN>` 参数决定调参 RC 通道处于 ``RCx_MIN`` 时的值。"

