#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:206
#: ce68c406dd264793aeb47c7edad23759
msgid "Saving the tuning results"
msgstr "保存调参结果"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:208
#: fdc617687ad0469eb87525b5420825c6
msgid ""
"When you are happy with the tune you can save the result by holding the "
"selector switch for more than 5 seconds. After 5 seconds the board will make"
" a rapid bup-bip-bup-bip sound to indicate that the save is complete. If you"
" leave the selector switch in the high position then tuning will remain "
"disabled after the save."
msgstr ""
"对调参结果满意后，可持续按住选择开关超过 5 秒来保存结果。5 "
"秒后，飞控板将发出快速的「滴嘟滴嘟」声，表示保存完成。若您将选择开关保持在高位，保存后调参将保持禁用状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:215
#: 358b6ecc5b014c40836077de674520d2
msgid "Reverting the tune"
msgstr "还原调参"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:217
#: a72407d9477d456cbddc8d2b6a7ac4ce
msgid ""
"If you are not happy with your tuning results or the vehicle becomes "
"unstable you should change flight mode. Any change of flight mode will "
"immediately revert all of the parameters you are tuning to the last saved "
"value. However, you can prevent this reversion upon flight mode change by "
"setting the :ref:`TUNE_MODE_REVERT<TUNE_MODE_REVERT>` parameter to 0."
msgstr ""
"若对调参结果不满意或飞行器变得不稳定，应切换飞行模式。任何飞行模式切换都会立即将所有正在调整的参数恢复为最后一次保存的值。但是，您可以通过将 "
":ref:`TUNE_MODE_REVERT<TUNE_MODE_REVERT>` 参数设为 0 来阻止飞行模式切换时的还原。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:224
#: 9b4ee10be0be4e78a6347f4b14c4d35e
msgid "The tuning process"
msgstr "调参过程"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:226
#: 44d08589ba9441e4b62a5a06152691f2
msgid ""
"The tuning system is designed to make it easy to quickly get a reasonable "
"manual tune on a vehicle in one flight. The most common use for this type of"
" tuning will be in adjusting the rate roll and pitch PID gains. The tuning "
"procedure outlined below is for that particular case."
msgstr ""
"调参系统旨在让您能够在一次飞行中快速对飞行器完成合理的手动调参。此类调参最常见的用途是调整横滚和俯仰的角速度 PID "
"增益。以下概述的调参步骤针对的正是这种情况。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:233
#: 69a3f9dd8cd84939ba50ed5340ef76a9
msgid "Setting up"
msgstr "设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:235
#: 21e059774dd24eeea12560db396fed60
msgid ""
"To setup for tuning your rate PIDs you should set "
":ref:`TUNE_CHAN<TUNE_CHAN>` to your tuning channel, "
":ref:`TUNE_SELECTOR<TUNE_SELECTOR>` to your selector switch and "
":ref:`TUNE_PARAM<TUNE_PARAM>` to 101 (which is the \"rate roll and pitch "
"PIDs tuning set\")."
msgstr ""
"要设置角速度 PID 调参，应将 :ref:`TUNE_CHAN<TUNE_CHAN>` 设为调参通道，将 "
":ref:`TUNE_SELECTOR<TUNE_SELECTOR>` 设为选择开关，并将 :ref:`TUNE_PARAM<TUNE_PARAM>` "
"设为 101（即「横滚和俯仰角速度 PID 调参集」）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:239
#: 5d2e4e1e93524c37b4362101dada83c4
msgid ""
"Then takeoff and switch the vehicle to a comfortable flight mode for rate "
"tuning. For a QuadPlane QHOVER or QLOITER are the best choices."
msgstr "然后起飞并将飞行器切换到适合角速度调参的舒适飞行模式。对于四旋翼飞机，QHover 或 QLoiter 是最佳选择。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:243
#: f1f44ed1285d48b2a0b20623f42b847d
msgid ""
"The first parameter you will be tuning will be RateRollD. To tune that "
"parameter (and the other parameters in the rate roll/pitch set) you should "
"follow this process:"
msgstr "首先需要调参的参数是 RateRollD。要调整该参数（以及横滚/俯仰角速度集中的其他参数），应按照以下步骤操作："

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:247
#: 184c16e9d5ae4f539235c138cd7462c0
msgid ""
"move the tuning knob to the mid-point to activate the knob. You will hear a "
"rapid bup-bip from the board to indicate the tuning knob is activated."
msgstr "将调参旋钮移至中间位置以激活旋钮。您将听到飞控板发出快速的「滴嘟」声，表示调参旋钮已激活。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:250
#: 8314c68b97e24bc2bb98a62203d5365d
msgid ""
"start raising the tuning knob slowly, stopping immediately if the vehicle "
"starts to oscillate. While you raise the gain you should give some small "
"roll inputs on the sticks."
msgstr "缓慢向上调整调参旋钮，一旦飞行器开始振荡立即停止。在提升增益的同时，应给予一些小的横滚摇杆输入。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:253
#: f4bdf966f81f44d7bbc8f0577821f8e8
msgid ""
"if you get to the top of the tuning knob range and the vehicle has not yet "
"started to oscillate then use the selector switch to re-center the range, "
"then move the tuning knob to the mid-point to reactivate the tuning knob"
msgstr "如果调参旋钮已到达行程顶端而飞行器仍未开始振荡，则使用选择开关重新居中范围，然后将调参旋钮移至中间位置以重新激活调参旋钮"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:257
#: 1c89bee467c5413480d073be7d98d7f6
msgid ""
"as soon as you see oscillation you should immediately lower the tuning knob "
"to the point where the oscillation just stops"
msgstr "一旦观察到振荡，应立即将调参旋钮降低至振荡刚好停止的位置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:259
#: 503cb80da89649f28d58596a1f0505da
msgid ""
"once the oscillation stops then re-center the tuning knob using the selector"
" switch, then move it to the mid-point to activate it, and then lower the "
"tuning knob all the way down. That will move the tuning value to half of the"
" value that just stopped the oscillation (assuming a "
":ref:`TUNE_RANGE<TUNE_RANGE>` of 2). Moving to half of that value will give "
"you enough margin in your tune to ensure your vehicle can handle a wide "
"range of flight conditions."
msgstr ""
"振荡停止后，使用选择开关重新居中调参旋钮，然后移至中间位置激活，再将调参旋钮一路降至最低。这将把调参值调整为刚好停止振荡时值的一半（假设 "
":ref:`TUNE_RANGE<TUNE_RANGE>` 为 2）。调整为该值的一半将为您的调参提供足够的裕量，确保飞行器能够应对各种飞行条件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:267
#: 4fcdeeae0476485b9b0ac84dab1961d8
msgid ""
"Once you have completed the above process for the first parameter then you "
"can move to the 2nd parameter by holding the selector switch for a count of "
"3. You will hear a BEEP BEEP sound from the vehicle indicating that you have"
" moved to parameter 2, which is the RateRollPI parameters. You should then "
"repeat exactly the same tuning process with that parameter."
msgstr ""
"对第一个参数完成上述步骤后，可通过持续按住选择开关数到 3 来切换到第 2 个参数。您将听到飞行器发出「嘟嘟」声，表示已切换到第 2 个参数，即 "
"RateRollPI 参数。然后对该参数重复完全相同的调参过程。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:274
#: 342095905c244885ba43cc7a09adea64
msgid ""
"Keep tuning each parameter in turn using the above process until you are "
"happy with all of them and then save your new tuning parameters by holding "
"the selector switch for more than five seconds. You will know the 5 seconds "
"is up when you hear the distinctive rapid bup-bip-bup-bip sound from the "
"buzzer."
msgstr ""
"按上述步骤依次调整每个参数，直到对所有参数都满意后，持续按住选择开关超过五秒来保存新的调参参数。当您听到蜂鸣器发出独特的快速「滴嘟滴嘟」声时，即表示 5"
" 秒已到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:280
#: 853b0fe04b1c4703a16faf8f6aa6bf76
msgid "At that point, you can land the vehicle, or just enjoy flying it."
msgstr "此时，您可以降落飞行器，或直接享受飞行乐趣。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-transmitter-tuning.rst:282
#: ced5f6de9171449fbf3c2a85f4f2fee1
msgid ""
"The first time you do a full tune in this way it will probably take about "
"five minutes of flight time to do a tune. With some practice, you can do a "
"full tune in a bit over a minute."
msgstr "第一次以这种方式进行完整调参，大约需要五分钟的飞行时间。熟练之后，完整调参可以在一分钟多一点的时间内完成。"
